Z||000008||The Fieromaster||12-18-2001||10:35 PM||||All i gotta say is make sure if you put it in the trunk to make something so that it dont bang around... your not even supposed to MOVE your computer while the hard drives are spinning (as it would if you were playing music) cause you can crash the fragile readers into the hard drive disks... Laptops however are build differently!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">        <FONT COLOR="red"><B>"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT></B>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/thefieromastersig.gif">    <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AOL IM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||1
